              "text": "gracilis, gracile — \"slender, slim\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Puella gracilis et alta est. The girl is slender and tall."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Two endings. Slim in a graceful way; macer is thin from want."
            }
          ]
        },
